# Everything in this repo is fleet policy, including the workflow that validates it and this file
# itself — so ownership is repo-wide rather than per-document. A narrower rule would let someone
# change the rules in the same PR that changes the policy.
#
# CODEOWNERS is only enforced when the branch protection rule on the default branch has
# "Require review from Code Owners" enabled. Without that toggle this file only auto-requests
# reviewers, and does not require them.
#
# The team must exist and must have write access to this repo, or GitHub treats the entry as
# unresolvable and requests nobody.
* @RunOnFlux/policy-owners
